# CASM Phase 13 WP81 trusted reference: casmres1
#
# Independently hand-assembled from the casmres1 fixture source in
# cmake/GenerateCasmTestFixtures.cmake. NOT produced by CASM. Proves .RES's
# two-operand (explicit fill value) and one-operand (default fill value 0)
# forms both produce correct bytes through the real production parser/
# emitter (parser.s's ppsFillDirective, emit.s's emitRes/emitFillLoop).
#
# Source (.ORG $C000, fixed address -- no relocatable symbols involved):
#   .ORG $C000
#   .RES 3,$AA   ; 3 bytes, each $AA
#   .RES 2       ; 2 bytes, default value $00 (no second operand)
#
# Hand assembly:
#   00 C0        PRG load-address header ($C000, little-endian)
#   AA AA AA     .RES 3,$AA
#   00 00        .RES 2 (default fill value 0)
#
# bytes: 7

00 C0
AA AA AA
00 00
